  "text": "## PART 6: Regulatory Context  \n### COBS (Conduct of Business Rules)  \n**Key Rules:**\n- Explain products clearly\n- Don't recommend unsuitable products\n- Disclose all fees\n- Obtain informed consent  \n**In Practice:**\n- Always explain what each product is\n- Ask about customer needs before recommending\n- Show interest rates and fees clearly\n- Get customer agreement before opening account",
